{% comment %}
  snippet: gl-search-value-translations.liquid
  ---------------------------------------------------------------
  Single source of truth for the English->Spanish label/value
  translation maps used by translateCardToSpanish() (see
  weapons-collection.liquid and home-product-search.liquid), which
  translates /en/search results back to Spanish for Spanish-locale
  visitors. Previously duplicated byte-for-byte in both sections;
  now rendered from here so there is exactly one copy.

  The translated text itself lives in locales/es.json (and
  locales/en.default.json, which just stores the matching English
  key text) under the "custom.gunval_*" keys, editable via Shopify
  Admin -> Settings -> Languages -> Manage translations, without a
  developer or a deploy. This snippet only maps each raw catalog
  value to its translation key -- that mapping itself doesn't
  change, since it's a fixed/closed vocabulary of firearm data
  (calibers, actions, materials, etc.), not day-to-day copy.
{% endcomment %}
