  "View N Firearm options" / "See option and where to buy" button text,
  reusing the existing pluralized custom.weapon_options key (same key the
  button renders from natively). count:1 gives the singular form; count:2
  is a sentinel to get the plural template, whose digit gets swapped for
  the real count at runtime in translateCardToSpanish().
{% endcomment %}
